{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "翼水反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "右\n聖武帝願文也，可觀為國家祈福之盛意矣。又按\n慶安手鑑暨耳比磨利帖，共載　聖武天皇宸翰，\n\n世謂之　大聖武，盖以字體　大於常也。此註楞\n伽經，筆力遒勁，鳳翥龍躍，自有天人步虛之勢，所\n謂\n大聖武者也。不勝激賞裝潢，以十襲寶重焉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明治十年十月念五日\n大教正華頂山第七十五世順徹定識"}
{"id": null, "n": "0091001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0091001", "type": "orig", "text": "插入首題"}
{"id": null, "n": "0091002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0091002", "type": "orig", "text": "釋一切佛語心品第一之一偈文"}
{"id": null, "n": "0091003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0091003", "type": "orig", "text": "歸下疑脫實字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0092001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0092001", "type": "orig", "text": "所下佚失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0092002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0092002", "type": "orig", "text": "插入首題"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094001", "type": "orig", "text": "或與惑通下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0094002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0094002", "type": "orig", "text": "經無無字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0097001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0097001", "type": "orig", "text": "云疑亡"}
{"id": null, "n": "0098001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0098001", "type": "orig", "text": "云疑亡"}
{"id": null, "n": "0098002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0098002", "type": "orig", "text": "聖下經有智字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100001", "type": "orig", "text": "計下經有著字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100002", "type": "orig", "text": "是等八字經置前離有非有下"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100003", "type": "orig", "text": "心上經有善知二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0102001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0102001", "type": "orig", "text": "遠下佚失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0102002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0102002", "type": "orig", "text": "熟疑孰"}
{"id": null, "n": "0102003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0102003", "type": "orig", "text": "經卷二"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104001", "type": "orig", "text": "插入尾題"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104002", "type": "orig", "text": "經卷三"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104003", "type": "orig", "text": "□疑益"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104004", "type": "orig", "text": "□□疑通謂"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104005", "type": "orig", "text": "□疑內或自"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104006", "type": "orig", "text": "□疑無"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104007", "type": "orig", "text": "□疑地"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104008", "type": "orig", "text": "□疑之"}
{"id": null, "n": "0104009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0104009", "type": "orig", "text": "名疑石"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105001", "type": "orig", "text": "諸疑請"}
{"id": null, "n": "0105002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0105002", "type": "orig", "text": "現經作見"}
{"id": null, "n": "0106001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0106001", "type": "orig", "text": "怨疑恐"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107001", "type": "orig", "text": "諸疑謂"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107002", "type": "orig", "text": "不經作非"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107003", "type": "orig", "text": "氣下經有計著生三字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0108001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0108001", "type": "orig", "text": "上下經或有智字或無"}
{"id": null, "n": "0108002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0108002", "type": "orig", "text": "墮上經有復次二字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0110001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0110001", "type": "orig", "text": "習下經有生字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0110002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0110002", "type": "orig", "text": "生字疑衍"}
{"id": null, "n": "0110003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0110003", "type": "orig", "text": "通上經或有神字或無"}
{"id": null, "n": "0110004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0110004", "type": "orig", "text": "示疑大"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111001", "type": "orig", "text": "聞經作問次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111002 #note_star_1 #note_star_2", "type": "orig", "text": "大上經有復次二字下同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111003", "type": "orig", "text": "彼下經有中字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112001", "type": "orig", "text": "大等五字經作世尊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0112002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0112002", "type": "orig", "text": "即疑印"}
{"id": null, "n": "0113001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0113001", "type": "orig", "text": "實下經有知字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0114001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0114001", "type": "orig", "text": "性下經有相字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0114002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0114002", "type": "orig", "text": "離下佚失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0114003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0114003", "type": "orig", "text": "經卷四"}
{"id": null, "n": "0114004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0114004", "type": "orig", "text": "邪下佚失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0115001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0115001", "type": "orig", "text": "似下佚失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0115002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0115002", "type": "orig", "text": "諸下佚失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0115003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0115003", "type": "orig", "text": "相下佚失"}
{"id": null, "n": "0115004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0115004", "type": "orig", "text": "徹定師見此注原本筆跡為聖武天皇宸笔附此詔勅今姑載之以供大方雅覽云"}
